### Generar QR de matriz rectangular 2 x 3
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrix": [
        [1, 2, 3],
        [4, 5, 6]
    ]
}

### Generar QR de matriz rectangular 3 x 2
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrix": [
        [1,2],
        [3,4],
        [5,6]
    ]
}

### Generar QR de matriz rectangular 3 x 3
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrix": [
        [1,2,6.7],
        [3,4,3.4],
        [5,6,0]
    ]
}

### Calcular estadísticas
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/statistics
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "matrices": {
        "q": [
            [1e200]
        ],
        "r": [
            [1]
        ]
    }
}